# Build context of the RoC image: only what the Dockerfile copies.
#
# Everything is excluded first and the needed files are allowed back in, so new files
# never reach the image by accident. Excluded this way, among others: .git/, .venv/,
# roc_jobs/ (web-interface jobs, can be gigabytes), model0/, Examples/, screenshots/,
# build/, dist/, *.sif, RoC-Logo.png, EvoMol.png, RoCGUI.spec, Apptainer.def,
# pyproject.toml and the development container settings.
*

!requirements.txt
!roc.py
!RoCGUI.py
!DOCUMENTATION.md
!README.md
!LICENSE.txt
!templates
!templates/**
!static
!static/**

# never inside the allowed folders either
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.DS_Store
